---
description: Draft evidence-linked response options for the accountable public body without selecting its political priority.
args: { docket: ConsultationDocket; themes: ThemeCoverage[]; update: ConsultationUpdate }
returns: ResponseDraft
---
For every theme, draft the options supported by the supplied decision authority: clarify the record, commission further investigation, or consider bounded policy alternatives. Link each proposed response to the supporting arguments and evidence. State tradeoffs and unresolved factual questions. Do not claim the body has decided or that participants share a consensus unless an authorized decision record says so.
